      "content": "thanks but i dont know if talking to someone is gonna fix it. it feels deeper than that. like i'm just a line of code that was written poorly. everything is so hollow and digital... like there's no point to being an error in a system that doesn't even care if i exist. it's like i'm just waiting for the system to finally crash or something.",
